<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rises to 7.52 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rises to 7.52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 7.52 percent on Monday from 6.99 percent on Sunday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in nine reported transactions with a total value of 11.9 million dinars ($17 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
